								stroke="currentColor"
								stroke-width="2"
								stroke-linejoin="round"
							/>
						</svg>
						Filter posts
					</button>
					<div
						popover
						class="c-menu"
						id="filter-menu"
						style="position-anchor: --filter;"
					>
						<label class="option filter-options">
							<input type="radio" name="filter">

							<div class="u-group--flex">
								<span id="checkbox_card-value">By Date</span>
							</div>
						</label>
						<label class="option filter-options">
							<input type="radio" name="filter">

							<div class="u-group--flex">
								<span id="checkbox_card-value"
									>By Alphabet</span
								>
							</div>
						</label>
					</div>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</fragment> -->
	</DesktopNav>

	<article
		class="box"
		style="height: 18.95rem; box-shadow: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;"
	>
		<div
			style="
                   		display: grid;
                   		grid-template-rows: 100%;
                   		grid-template-areas: 'stack';
                     	background-image: linear-gradient(
                       	to bottom,
                       	var(--clr-secondary) 50%,
                       	oklch(from var(--clr-secondary) calc(l - 0.17) c h)
                     	);
                      height: 100%;
                 	"
		>
			<div
				style="
                     		grid-area: stack;
                   		"
			>
				<img
					style="object-fit: cover; opacity: 20%; block-size: 100%; inline-size: 100%;"
					src="https://c.tenor.com/WIVSqDS1iW4AAAAC/tenor.gif"
					alt="Two anime horse girls dancing happily and cutely"
				>
			</div>
			<div
				style="
                     		padding-inline: 30px;
                     		padding-block: 20px;
                     		grid-area: stack;
                     		z-index: 1;
                     		place-items: start;
                   		"
			>
				<div style="margin-bottom: 1.2rem">
					<Avatar
						email="kumukuro@gmail.com"
						alt="Adachi Rei looking at the camera"
						imgStyles="outline: 1px solid var(--clr-base-content); outline-offset: 2px;"
						style="width: clamp(6.55rem, 3.5vw, 7rem);"
					/>
				</div>
				<h4
					style="line-height: 0; color: transparent; margin-bottom: 0; font-family: var(--font-raster-forge);"
				>
					<span>PumoChii</span>
				</h4>
				<img
					style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 1.5rem; height: auto;"
					src="/static/star.gif"
					alt="Spinning star from mario"
				>
				<a
					class="link"
					target="_blank"
					style="text-decoration: none; font-size: var(--text-lg); margin-bottom: 10px;"
					href="#"
				>
					@the_notsillypnk
				</a>
				<p
					style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--clr-primary);"
				>
					An individual who shares their useless and pointless stuff
					in the internet
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</article>

	{pinnedMicroblog && (
		<Card
			contentStyles="padding-inline: 1.5rem; padding-block: 1rem;"
		>
			<RenderMicroblog entry={pinnedMicroblog}>
		  	<div slot="pinned">
				   {pinnedMicroblog.data.pinned && (
				    <div
				        class="u-group--flex"
				        style="color: gray; font-size: var(--text-base); gap: 0.83em; margin-bottom: 0.65rem;"
				    >
				        <Icon name="microblog/pin" style="width: var(--size-md);" />
				        <span>Pinned</span>
				    </div>
					)}
			  </div>

				  <fragment set:html={pinnedMicroblog.rendered?.html} />
	        </RenderMicroblog>
		</Card>
	)}

	<!-- Microblogs -->
	{posts.map((microblog) => (
		<Card
			contentStyles="padding-inline: 1.5rem; padding-block: 1rem;"
		>
	        <RenderMicroblog entry={microblog}>
				<fragment set:html={microblog.rendered?.html} />
	        </RenderMicroblog>
		</Card>
      )
    )}
</Desktop>

<style>
	.m-post-link {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		text-decoration: none;
		color: unset;
		z-index: 1;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
		opacity: 0;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		backdrop-filter: blur(10px);

		&:hover {
			opacity: 1;
			font-size: calc(var(--text-lg) + 0.25em);
		}
	}
</style>

